{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23399","headline":"秋池二首 一 · 白居易","name":"秋池二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身闲无所爲，心闲无所思。\n况当故园夜，复此新秋池。\n岸闇鸟栖後，桥明月出时。\n菱风香散漫，桂露光参差。\n静境多独得，幽怀竟谁知。\n悠然心中语，自问来何迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}